---
subject: Reset your password
layout: DefaultEmail
description: Password reset email template
metadata:
  type: Email
  version: "5.0"
---
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td class="greeting ink" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.35; padding-bottom: 14px;">
            Reset your password
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="ink-soft" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4a5568;">
            Hi @(Model.UserName ?? "there"), we got a request to reset your password. Nothing has changed yet.
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<!-- CTA -->
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" class="btn" style="margin: 26px 0 0 0;">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#0f3460" style="border-radius: 8px;">
            <!--[if mso]>
            <v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="@Model.ResetUrl" style="height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:220px;" arcsize="16%" fillcolor="#0f3460" stroke="false">
            <w:anchorlock/>
            <center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;">Choose a new password</center>
            </v:roundrect>
            <![endif]-->
            <!--[if !mso]><!-->
            <a href="@Model.ResetUrl" target="_blank" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #0f3460; text-align: center;">Choose a new password</a>
            <!--<![endif]-->
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<!-- Expiry + copyable link -->
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 22px;">
    <tr>
        <td class="ink-soft" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568; padding-bottom: 10px;">
            The link expires in @(Model.ExpirationMinutes ?? 60) minutes.
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="ink-faint" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8b929b;">
            Or paste this into your browser:<br>
            <a href="@Model.ResetUrl" style="color: #6b7280; text-decoration: underline; word-break: break-all;">@Model.ResetUrl</a>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<!-- Reassurance -->
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 22px;">
    <tr>
        <td class="ink-faint" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8b929b;">
            Didn't ask for this? Ignore this email - your password stays the same.
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
